<header><p class="enc-kicker">People / group</p><h1 class="enc-title">Sangama dynasty</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1336">1336</a>–<a href="/years/1485">1485</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/14th-century">14th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Sangama dynasty was the first ruling house of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/vijayanagara-empire">Vijayanagara Empire</a>, founded around 1336 by the brothers <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/harihara-i">Harihara I</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bukka-raya-i">Bukka I</a>, sons of Sangama. Its kings conquered the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/hoysala-empire">Hoysala</a> lands and the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/madurai-sultanate">Madurai Sultanate</a>, fought long wars with the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bahmani-sultanate">Bahmani Sultanate</a> and reached their height under <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/deva-raya-ii">Deva Raya II</a>. The dynasty was overthrown around 1485 by the general <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/saluva-narasimha">Saluva Narasimha</a>.</p></div>
